{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016145738778-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016152919\"/><p>被捕男子遭押走。</p><p>近日，一名男子經常在元朗錦田一帶，訛稱家人患病急需用錢博取村民同情，騙取金錢後逃去。該男子於10月9日清晨再重施故技，向一名的士司機借錢後失蹤。警員經展開深入調查後鎖定目標，昨日（15日）成功拘捕該名男子，涉嫌「以欺騙手段取得財產」。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T07:41:39.946060+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T06:57:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T07:37:53.069584+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:37:53.069584+00:00","content_hash":"d417eb443b4978b0a8c23caa00615f90d99ece2aa89d10a7ffbccdcde8c9053a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}